# Netty Boss/Worker 线程模型
direction: down

Boss EventLoopGroup: {
  label: Boss EventLoopGroup（1 个 EventLoop）
  style.fill: "#EEF1F8"
  bossLoop: "EventLoop Thread-1\n只处理 OP_ACCEPT" {
    style.fill: "#E3E9FD"
  }
}

Worker EventLoopGroup: {
  label: Worker EventLoopGroup（N 个 EventLoop，CPU 核数 × 2）
  style.fill: "#EEF1F8"
  loop1: "EventLoop Thread-2" {
    style.fill: "#FFFFFF"
  }
  loop2: "EventLoop Thread-3" {
    style.fill: "#FFFFFF"
  }
  loop3: "EventLoop Thread-4" {
    style.fill: "#FFFFFF"
  }
}

pipeline: {
  label: "ChannelPipeline\nDecoder → Handler → Encoder"
  style.fill: "#E8F5E9"
}

Boss EventLoopGroup.bossLoop -> Worker EventLoopGroup: accept 后轮询分配给 Worker EventLoop
Worker EventLoopGroup.loop1 -> pipeline: 绑定 Channel
Worker EventLoopGroup.loop2 -> pipeline: 绑定 Channel
Worker EventLoopGroup.loop3 -> pipeline: 绑定 Channel